{"result":"{
  "id": "19184",
  "key": "SFCC-736",
  "summary": "pdp/drawer",
  "description": "As a Developer, \nI want a reusable pdp/drawer React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \nso that it can be used on the PDP to render the slide-in panel that houses tabbed product information (Details & Care, Size Guide, Find My Size, Shipping & Returns, Assistance).\n\n----\n\nThe component is responsible for the drawer shell only — the slide-in panel, overlay backdrop, close button, and tab navigation header. It does not own the content rendered within each tab; that is covered in the relevant PDP functional stories (SFCC-102, SFCC-101, SFCC-195, SFCC-266, SFCC-267). The component accepts tab content as children.",
